Two inventions defined this industry:

• Nakamoto Consensus: Proof-of-Work made Bitcoin the most secure blockchain.
• The EVM: added programmability to Bitcoin's basic design — smart contracts.

Ethereum Classic takes the best from both worlds: Programmable Digital Gold.